                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Every row is a skill/plugin observed in the connected Purview audit data. IsMapped flags any skill not yet matched to a category. Skill Invocations and Skill Users are measured per skill. Skill-Sliced Assisted Hours and Estimated Value resolve to the skill's parent Category total and repeat across skills sharing that category because the source does not provide per-skill task value. Sorted unmapped skills first, then by invocation count. Use the Category and Value Tier slicers, or the cards above, for page-level totals.",
